title: scavenger_king_start
tags: station_pirate
---
This isn't a station; it's a hundred dead ships welded together. The 'King' hails you. He sits on a throne made of Vanguard plating. 'You want to pass? Pay the toll, or become a brick in my wall.' #line:scavenger_king_start_00
-> Pay Toll <<if (credits() >= 50) and (credits() >= 50)>> #line:scavenger_king_start_01
    <<take_credits 50>>
    <<stop>>
-> Challenge #line:scavenger_king_start_02
    <<start_combat encounter_scavenger_king>>
-> Trade Info #line:scavenger_king_start_03
    <<jump scavenger_king_king_impressed>>
===

title: scavenger_king_king_impressed
tags: 
---
The King laughs. 'A hunter! I like hunters.' He lets you pass and gives you a weapon from his vault. #line:scavenger_king_king_impressed_00
-> Accept Gift #line:scavenger_king_king_impressed_01
    <<give_item item_scrap_cannon 1>>
    <<stop>>
